entries[246344] = { ["name"] = "Cursed Stone Idol", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\n+18 [Agility or Strength]\nUse: Channel for 1 sec to invoke the wrath of the idol, increasing your Critical Strike by 116 for 15 sec. The force slams the earth, dealing 1913 Nature damage to all nearby enemies and increasing Critical Strike by 6 per enemy hit, up to a maximum of 145 . (1 Min, 30 Sec Cooldown)\nComplete Halls of Atonement within the time limit at keystone level 12 or higher during the War Within Season Three.\nSell Price:" }
